  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups rolled oats",
    "1 cup puffed brown rice cereal",
    "0.5 cup chopped raw almonds",
    "0.33 cup shredded coconut",
    "3 tablespoons unsweetened cocoa powder",
    "1 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "tiny pinch cayenne pepper",
    "0.5 cup maple syrup",
    "0.33 cup packed brown sugar",
    "2 tablespoons vegetable oil",
    "1 tablespoon water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all your ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease an 8x8 pan with butter; line with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U0XB3ylzoZTK0tVibTFhxOQ4abc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8529886-chocolate-cereal-breakfast-bars-VAT-ingredients-c2b62df043904d56bfc0ee6b3272b088.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8529886/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine rolled oats, puffed brown rice cereal, almonds, coconut, cocoa powder, salt, and cayenne pepper in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U6FtBLoOAeCTCJACDSfCXnHKUsM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8529886-chocolate-cereal-breakfast-bars-VAT-step-01-90760fdfa6574a2bbf2c8d7775efb20f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8529886/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine maple syrup, brown sugar, vegetable oil, and water in a small saucepan; bring to a simmer over medium-high heat. Stir; boil mixture for 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Oxoj9cyuoRVPvDLuONGXs0g25wA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8529886-chocolate-cereal-breakfast-bars-VAT-step-02-bda008d2e8d94301a42bca136ba2d8aa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8529886/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour maple syrup mixture over oats mixture; mix thoroughly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ofbyJBW6_mO7bkEVMRIcfWBk6bg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8529886-chocolate-cereal-breakfast-bars-VAT-step-03-3896cdeab4da42ba822be9140da0c073.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8529886/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer oats mixture to the prepared pan; smooth top, pressing lightly with a spatula.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1OL6ozk3oJhjFf5oMugQD5U66iA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8529886-chocolate-cereal-breakfast-bars-VAT-step-04-67508473fff24560ae48fc7d467c9cb2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8529886/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 25 minutes. Score into 8 bars while still hot using a spatula.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l9xLsKgqumDTxDIrW3hTXFOVm6o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8529886-chocolate-cereal-breakfast-bars-VAT-step-05-a-330727254bef4c8f83d3fc287bbeb483.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8529886/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool to room temperature before breaking into bars. (You can also not score, and simply cool, then cut with a knife.)",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x8Yj20ogqb2eB5_MXyPPdvNMrOI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8529886-chocolate-cereal-breakfast-bars-VAT-step-05-b-fcb5e24bd38f41a9a5780c808f629043.jpg"
      ],
